  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Institute of Tropical Agriculture   MIRACLE Project 2010 -2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Institute of Trpoical Agriculture   MIRACLE Project 2010 -2015 - Food Security Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nutrition plays a significant role in prevention of HIv through reduction of biological and social vulnerabilities. In treatment and care, drugs are only effective when combined with good nutrition. Under impact mitigation, labour saving technologies are key for sustained food production under resource poor settings. The project promotes food production and links to markets for vulnerables.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">N&#xE4;ring spelar en viktig roll i att f&#xF6;rebygga hiv genom reduktion av biologiska och sociala s&#xE5;rbarheter. Vid behandling och v&#xE5;rd, l&#xE4;kemedel &#xE4;r endast effektivt i kombination med bra n&#xE4;ring. Enligt resultat h&#xE4;rav, arbetsbesparande teknik &#xE4;r nyckeln till uth&#xE5;llig livsmedelsproduktion i resurssvaga inst&#xE4;llningar. Projektet fr&#xE4;mjar produktionen och l&#xE4;nkar till marknader f&#xF6;r vulnerables mat.</narrative>
  </description>
